  "Question": "When the ones total ten or more, carry 1 to the tens place. In \\(27+5\\), the ones calculation \\(7+5\\) totals ten or more. What should happen in the tens place?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Carry 1 to the tens place",
    "B": "Borrow 1 from the ones place",
    "C": "Change the tens digit to 0"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Write 2 in the ones place. Add the carried 1 to the 2 in the tens place to get 3, giving 32.",
